    <section class="hero section-tight">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="hero-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumbs"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / Services</nav>
        <h1>Services designed for comfort and results</h1>
        <p class="lead">We personalize every plan to fit your health, timeline, and budget. Explore what we offer below, then book a visit to create your roadmap together.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="preventive" class="section">
      <div class="container grid grid-3">
        <article class="card service-card">
          <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Preventive</span></div>
          <h3>Cleanings & Exams</h3>
          <p>Gentle cleanings and comprehensive screenings to keep small issues small. Digital X‑rays minimize exposure while maximizing clarity.</p>
          <p class="help">Recommended every 6 months</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card service-card">
          <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Preventive</span></div>
          <h3>Periodontal Therapy</h3>
          <p>Targeted care for gums and bone support. Non‑surgical and surgical options depending on your needs.</p>
          <p class="help">Includes deep cleanings and maintenance</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card service-card">
          <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Preventive</span></div>
          <h3>Night Guards & Sports Guards</h3>
          <p>Custom appliances protect teeth from grinding and sports impacts. Better sleep, fewer headaches.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cosmetic" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="stack" style="--stack-gap:1rem">
          <h2>Cosmetic & smile design</h2>
          <p class="lead">Subtle upgrades or full‑smile transformations—always shaped to your features and goals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-3 mt-2">
          <article class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Cosmetic</span></div>
            <h3>Professional Whitening</h3>
            <p>In‑office and take‑home options for brighter teeth safely and quickly.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Cosmetic</span></div>
            <h3>Bonding & Contouring</h3>
            <p>Refine shape, close small gaps, and repair chips in a single visit.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Cosmetic</span><span class="pill">Premium</span></div>
            <h3>Porcelain Veneers</h3>
            <p>Durable, natural‑looking results tailored to your smile, not a template.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="restorative" class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Restorative & implants</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-3 mt-2">
          <article class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Restorative</span><span class="pill">Same‑day</span></div>
            <h3>Crowns & Onlays</h3>
            <p>Strengthen cracked or worn teeth with custom, tooth‑colored restorations. Many completed in a single day.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Implants</span></div>
            <h3>Dental Implants</h3>
            <p>Replace missing teeth with stable, natural‑feeling implants and lifelike crowns.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-meta"><span class="pill">Restorative</span></div>
            <h3>Tooth‑Colored Fillings</h3>
            <p>Repair decay conservatively using strong composite materials that blend in beautifully.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="orthodontics" class="section">
      <div class="container grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Clear aligners</h2>
          <p>Straighten discreetly with clear aligners and digital tracking. Fewer visits, predictable results.</p>
          <div class="mt-2"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="book.html">Free consult</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Emergency dentistry</h2>
          <p>Same‑day care for toothaches, breaks, swelling, or lost fillings. We’ll relieve pain and plan next steps.</p>
          <div class="mt-2"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call {{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Comfort menu</h2>
        <div class="tag-pills mt-1">
          <span class="pill">Warm blankets</span>
          <span class="pill">Noise‑canceling headphones</span>
          <span class="pill">Aromatherapy</span>
          <span class="pill">Neck pillows</span>
          <span class="pill">Netflix + Spotify</span>
          <span class="pill">Gentle sedation options</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container card">
        <div class="grid grid-3">
          <div>
            <h3>Transparent pricing</h3>
            <p class="help">Every treatment includes a written estimate, your insurance benefits, and payment options.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
